     "id": "a66420c",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>How much does Schnitz cost? In most Australian stores a schnitzel wrap or burger sits between about <strong>$14 and $17 (approx.)</strong>, while a schnitzel plate with chips costs roughly <strong>$19.50 to $25.50 (approx.)</strong>. Kids meals start around <strong>$11 (approx.)</strong> and a dip is about <strong>$2 (approx.)</strong>.</p><p>The prices below are typical pickup prices collected from public sources and store listings. They change between states and stores, and delivery apps such as Uber Eats and DoorDash usually add a mark-up. Where we could not confirm a price, the table says <em>Varies</em> rather than guessing.</p>"
     },
